<p>For the next 5 turns you displace <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26%</acronym> of any damage you receive onto a random enemy.</p><p>While Webs of Fate is active you may gain one additional Spin per turn and your maximum Spin is doubled.</p>